      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-paper-design bundle patch: inserts the Paper MCP bridge plugin over the\n# profile root. The bridge connects to the Paper Desktop MCP server\n# (http://127.0.0.1:29979/mcp), registers paper_* tools on ctx.tools, injects\n# the Cursor-parity design guidance as a prompt section, registers the\n# paper-design skills, and exposes the /paper-reconnect command.\n#\n# The cordis:group realm keeps the service registrations out of the root realm\n# so the same bundle can be composed more than once without colliding.\n- insert:\n    - id: paper-realm\n      name: cordis:group\n      isolate:\n        paperDesign: true\n      config:\n        - id: paper-mcp\n          name: '@try-works/dsh-paper-design/src/index.ts'\n"
    }
